---
import AreaPage from '../layouts/AreaPage.astro';
import { areaBySlug } from '../data/areas';

const area = areaBySlug('ai-strategy')!;
---

<AreaPage area={area}>
  <Fragment slot="before-diagnostic">
    <h2>Three things we focus on</h2>
    <h3>1. Cost efficiency</h3>
    <p>
      Find out where your AI spend goes. Match the right model to each task, so
      you're not paying top-tier prices for simple work. Track cost per task, so
      spending follows value.
    </p>
    <h3>2. Governance</h3>
    <p>
      Set clear, right-sized rules for which tools are approved, what data can go
      into them, and how usage is tracked. They should be simple enough that
      people follow them, and firm enough to protect you.
    </p>
    <h3>3. Employee empowerment</h3>
    <p>
      Training and ready-to-use workflows, so people across the team use AI with
      confidence. Not just the technical few.
    </p>
  </Fragment>

  <Fragment slot="after-next">
    <h2>Why work with me</h2>
    <p>
      I've spent ten years helping teams make sense of their data, and I've
      trained more than 500 non-technical professionals along the way. Good AI
      adoption works the same way as good analytics: start with what's real,
      keep it right-sized, and leave the team able to run it on their own.
    </p>
  </Fragment>
</AreaPage>
